      "writtenOn": "2026-06-28T21:42:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "@michaelludwig@google.com - here is the link to the discussion: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/7966179/comment/be25eb5d_d07d0088/\n\ni think the blending equation is settled, it matches Apple\u0027s kCGBlendModePlusDarker, see https://developer.apple.com/documentation/coregraphics/cgblendmode/plusdarker), which is also what WebKit has shipped for years as BlendMode::PlusDarker. the SkSL in this CL is the alpha-aware form of that same formula.\n\ni am happy for any guidance, pretty much the first time having to touch skia.",
      "parentUuid": "70558082_0aaa7681",
      "revId": "90740bb1461c3a65b884ee9fc0000119264af945",
